When you open the support ticket, I suggest including a screenshot and the contents of the javascript console.

ppdrelease3 runs out of memory when the radius is too large, and the R process is killed as a consequence. This can be difficult to view on the metrics graph, since that data is sampled once per minute, and it seems to take much less time than that to consume the available memory.

